{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Brings.BringCoverTower","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Brings.BringCoverTower","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic"],"declarations":30,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Brings.CoverTower.projOrder5_discriminant_identity","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Brings.CoverTower.projOrder5_discriminant_identity","kind":"theorem","line":222,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Brings/BringCoverTower.lean#L222-L227","doc":"**Projective order 5 criterion (`t⁴ − 3 t² Δ + Δ² = 0`).** By Cayley–Hamilton `M² = t M − Δ I`,\n`M⁵ = (t⁴ − 3 t² Δ + Δ²) M − (t³ − 2 t Δ) Δ I`, and `(2 t² − 3 Δ)² − 5 Δ² = 4(t⁴ − 3 t² Δ + Δ²)`,\nshowing that projective order 5 requires `5` to be a square in the base field. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Brings.CoverTower.projOrder4_cayley_hamilton","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Brings.CoverTower.projOrder4_cayley_hamilton","kind":"theorem","line":215,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Brings/BringCoverTower.lean#L215-L220","doc":"**Projective order 4 criterion (`t² = 2 Δ`).** By Cayley–Hamilton `M² = t M − Δ I`,\nif `t² = 2 Δ` then `M⁴ = (t³ − 2 t Δ) M − (t² − d) Δ I = −Δ² I` (the `M`-coefficient\n`t(t² − 2 Δ)` vanishes and the scalar coefficient is `−(t² − Δ) Δ + t² Δ = −Δ²`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Brings.CoverTower.bringPSL2CoverGenus_values","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Brings.CoverTower.bringPSL2CoverGenus_values","kind":"theorem","line":202,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Brings/BringCoverTower.lean#L202-L209","doc":"Genera of the corresponding unramified `PSL₂(𝔽_p)`-covers `Σ_{g(p)} → Σ₄` over Bring's surface. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Brings.CoverTower.psl2_41_rh","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Brings.CoverTower.psl2_41_rh","kind":"theorem","line":200,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Brings/BringCoverTower.lean#L200-L200","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Brings.CoverTower.psl2_31_rh","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Brings.CoverTower.psl2_31_rh","kind":"theorem","line":198,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Brings/BringCoverTower.lean#L198-L199","doc":"**Macbeath `PSL₂(𝔽_p)` branch (`(2/p) = +1, (5/p) = +1`)**: `p = 31, 41`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Brings.CoverTower.pgl2_29_rh","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Brings.CoverTower.pgl2_29_rh","kind":"theorem","line":196,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Brings/BringCoverTower.lean#L196-L196","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Brings.CoverTower.pgl2_19_rh","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Brings.CoverTower.pgl2_19_rh","kind":"theorem","line":195,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Brings/BringCoverTower.lean#L195-L195","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Brings.CoverTower.pgl2_11_rh","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Brings.CoverTower.pgl2_11_rh","kind":"theorem","line":193,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Brings/BringCoverTower.lean#L193-L194","doc":"**Macbeath `PGL₂(𝔽_p)` branch (`(2/p) = −1, (5/p) = +1`)**: `p = 11, 19, 29`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Brings.CoverTower.bringPSL2Cover_rh","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Brings.CoverTower.bringPSL2Cover_rh","kind":"theorem","line":187,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Brings/BringCoverTower.lean#L187-L191","doc":"**Every unramified `PSL₂(𝔽_p)`-cover of Bring's surface satisfies `RH245`.** ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Brings.CoverTower.bringPSL2CoverGenus","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Brings.CoverTower.bringPSL2CoverGenus","kind":"def","line":183,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Brings/BringCoverTower.lean#L183-L185","doc":"Genus of the unramified `PSL₂(𝔽_p)`-cover `Σ_{g(p)} → Σ₄` over Bring's surface:\n`g(p) − 1 = |PSL₂(𝔽_p)| · (4 − 1) = 3 |PSL₂(𝔽_p)|`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Brings.CoverTower.bringPSL2CoverOrder","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Brings.CoverTower.bringPSL2CoverOrder","kind":"def","line":178,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Brings/BringCoverTower.lean#L178-L181","doc":"Order of the subdirect `(2,4,5)` cover group `G_p` (`S₅ × PSL₂(𝔽_p)` for `p ≡ ±1, ±9 mod 40`,\nor `S₅ ×_{C₂} PGL₂(𝔽_p)` for `p ≡ ±11, ±19 mod 40`) projecting onto `S₅` with deck group\n`PSL₂(𝔽_p)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Brings.CoverTower.psl2_five_not_rh245","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Brings.CoverTower.psl2_five_not_rh245","kind":"theorem","line":173,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Brings/BringCoverTower.lean#L173-L176","doc":"`PSL₂(𝔽₅) ≅ A₅` (`|G| = 60`) is **not** a smooth `(2,4,5)`-quotient (`40 ∤ 60`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Brings.CoverTower.bring_pgl2_five_rh","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Brings.CoverTower.bring_pgl2_five_rh","kind":"theorem","line":170,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Brings/BringCoverTower.lean#L170-L171","doc":"`PGL₂(𝔽₅) ≅ S₅` (`|G| = 120`) satisfies the `(2,4,5)` Riemann–Hurwitz relation at `g = 4`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Brings.CoverTower.bring_psl2_five_order","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Brings.CoverTower.bring_psl2_five_order","kind":"theorem","line":168,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Brings/BringCoverTower.lean#L168-L168","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Brings.CoverTower.bring_pgl2_five_order","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Brings.CoverTower.bring_pgl2_five_order","kind":"theorem","line":167,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Brings/BringCoverTower.lean#L167-L167","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Brings.CoverTower.psl2Order","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Brings.CoverTower.psl2Order","kind":"def","line":164,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Brings/BringCoverTower.lean#L164-L165","doc":"Order of `PSL₂(𝔽_p)` for an odd prime `p`: `p(p² − 1) / 2`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Brings.CoverTower.pgl2Order","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Brings.CoverTower.pgl2Order","kind":"def","line":161,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Brings/BringCoverTower.lean#L161-L162","doc":"Order of `PGL₂(𝔽_p)` for an odd prime `p`: `p(p² − 1)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Brings.CoverTower.towerGenus_one","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Brings.CoverTower.towerGenus_one","kind":"theorem","line":152,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Brings/BringCoverTower.lean#L152-L154","doc":"First level: `g_1 = 1 + 3 m⁸`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Brings.CoverTower.towerGenus_strictMono","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Brings.CoverTower.towerGenus_strictMono","kind":"theorem","line":149,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Brings/BringCoverTower.lean#L149-L150","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Brings.CoverTower.towerGenus_lt_succ","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Brings.CoverTower.towerGenus_lt_succ","kind":"theorem","line":138,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Brings/BringCoverTower.lean#L138-L147","doc":"**The tower is strictly increasing.** ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Brings.CoverTower.towerGenus_succ_ge","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Brings.CoverTower.towerGenus_succ_ge","kind":"theorem","line":129,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Brings/BringCoverTower.lean#L129-L136","doc":"**Growth: each step multiplies `g − 1` by `m^{2g}`**, so `g_{k+1} ≥ m^{2 g_k}`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Brings.CoverTower.four_le_towerGenus","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Brings.CoverTower.four_le_towerGenus","kind":"theorem","line":118,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Brings/BringCoverTower.lean#L118-L127","doc":"The genus at every level is at least 4. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Brings.CoverTower.tower_rh","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Brings.CoverTower.tower_rh","kind":"theorem","line":111,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Brings/BringCoverTower.lean#L111-L116","doc":"**Every level of the tower is a regular map of type (2,4,5).** ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Brings.CoverTower.rh_step","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Brings.CoverTower.rh_step","kind":"theorem","line":101,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Brings/BringCoverTower.lean#L101-L109","doc":"**Riemann–Hurwitz is preserved by one homology step.** ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Brings.CoverTower.towerOrder","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Brings.CoverTower.towerOrder","kind":"def","line":96,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Brings/BringCoverTower.lean#L96-L99","doc":"The automorphism-group order at each level: `|G_{k+1}| = m^{2 g_k} |G_k|`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Brings.CoverTower.towerGenus","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Brings.CoverTower.towerGenus","kind":"def","line":91,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Brings/BringCoverTower.lean#L91-L94","doc":"The mod-`m` homology tower over Bring's surface. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Brings.CoverTower.nextGenus","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Brings.CoverTower.nextGenus","kind":"def","line":88,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Brings/BringCoverTower.lean#L88-L89","doc":"The genus of the next level of the mod-`m` homology tower. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Brings.CoverTower.rh_genus_unique","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Brings.CoverTower.rh_genus_unique","kind":"theorem","line":84,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Brings/BringCoverTower.lean#L84-L86","doc":"Riemann–Hurwitz determines the genus from the group order. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Brings.CoverTower.bring_rh","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Brings.CoverTower.bring_rh","kind":"theorem","line":81,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Brings/BringCoverTower.lean#L81-L82","doc":"**Bring's surface**: `|S₅| = 120` forces genus 4. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Brings.CoverTower.RH245","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Brings.CoverTower.RH245","kind":"def","line":77,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Brings/BringCoverTower.lean#L77-L79","doc":"Riemann–Hurwitz for a regular map of type (2,4,5): `40 (g − 1) = |G|`, stated without\nsubtraction. ","signatureChunk":0}]}